<div class="page-wrap"><div class="eyebrow dark-eyebrow">REUSE, YOUR WAY</div><h1 class="page-title">Bữa ăn nào cũng có <em>chiếc hộp riêng.</em></h1><p class="page-lead">Chọn sản phẩm phù hợp, xem trước phí thuê và tiền cọc trước khi đặt.</p><form class="filter-bar" method="get"><label class="search-field">⌕ <input name="q" value="<?=e($q)?>" placeholder="Tìm hộp, dung tích, chất liệu…"></label><select name="category"><option value="0">Tất cả danh mục</option><?php foreach($categories as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>" <?=$categoryId==$c['id']?'selected':''?>><?=e($c['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><select name="sort"><option value="available">Phổ biến</option><option value="price">Giá thấp trước</option></select><button class="btn btn-dark">Lọc hộp</button></form><div class="product-grid catalog-grid"><?php foreach($products as $p):?><article class="product-card"><a class="product-image" href="<?=e(url('/product?id='.$p['id']))?>"><img src="<?=e($p['image_url'])?>" alt="<?=e($p['name'])?>" loading="lazy"><span class="product-tag"><?=e($p['category'])?></span><span class="product-arrow">↗</span></a><div class="product-info"><div><h3><?=e($p['name'])?></h3><p><?=number_format($p['capacity_ml'])?> ml · <?=e($p['material'])?></p></div><span class="stock-dot <?=$p['available']?'':'out'?>"></span></div><div class="product-price"><span><b><?=money($p['rental_price'])?></b> / ngày</span><span>cọc <?=money($p['deposit_amount'])?></span></div><p class="availability"><?=$p['available']?'Còn '.$p['available'].' hộp':'Tạm hết hộp'?></p><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('/cart/add'))?>" class="catalog-rent-form"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="product_id" value="<?=$p['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="catalog"><button class="btn btn-dark" <?=$p['available']?'':'disabled'?>><?=$p['available']?'Thuê hộp này':'Tạm hết hộp'?> <span>↗</span></button></form></article><?php endforeach;?></div></div>
